{"seq":91,"slug":"frontend-data-fetching-patterns","title":"前端数据请求模式","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.2,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端数据请求模式\">前端数据请求模式</h1><p>现代前端应用的复杂度已从 UI 渲染转移到数据层管理。请求的发起、缓存、失效、重试、乐观更新、实时同步——这些关注点交织在一起，构成了前端工程中最具挑战性的架构决策域。本 hub 系统性地覆盖从基础请求生命周期到生产级架构策略的完整知识体系，帮助开发者建立对&quot;前端如何与服务端状态协作&quot;的深度理解。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与相邻 hub 的分工边界明确：<strong>state-management-patterns</strong> 聚焦客户端状态的组织与流转（Zustand、Jotai、Redux slice 设计），本 hub 则专注服务端状态的获取与同步；<strong>react-in-depth</strong> 覆盖 React 框架本身的渲染机制与 hook 原理，本 hub 将这些机制作为已知前提来讨论数据层集成；<strong>performance-optimization</strong> 关注运行时性能（bundle、渲染、内存），本 hub 中涉及的性能话题仅限于网络请求维度的优化（瀑布流、预取、去重）。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先完成第一章「基础」建立请求生命周期、缓存策略与错误处理的心智模型，再进入第二章对比三大主流库的设计哲学与 API 差异，接着在第三章学习乐观更新、无限滚动和实时订阅等高级模式，最后在第四章将这些知识提升为架构层面的决策框架。</p>\n<p>前置知识：熟悉 JavaScript 异步编程（Promise、async/await）、React hooks 基础用法（useState、useEffect）、HTTP 协议基本概念（状态码、缓存头）。具备任意一个 React 项目的实际开发经验会大幅提升阅读收益。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"数据请求基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fetch-lifecycle-patterns","title":"请求生命周期与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/fetch-lifecycle-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"caching-stale-revalidation","title":"缓存策略与失效重验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/caching-stale-revalidation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"error-retry-resilience","title":"错误处理与重试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/error-retry-resilience"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"libraries","title":"主流数据请求库","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/libraries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tanstack-query-deep","title":"TanStack Query 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/libraries/tanstack-query-deep"},{"seq":2,"slug":"swr-vercel-patterns","title":"SWR 模式与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/libraries/swr-vercel-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rtk-query-redux","title":"RTK Query 与 Redux 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/libraries/rtk-query-redux"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-patterns","title":"高级数据模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optimistic-updates","title":"乐观更新与回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns/optimistic-updates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"infinite-scroll-pagination","title":"无限滚动与分页","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns/infinite-scroll-pagination"},{"seq":3,"slug":"realtime-subscriptions","title":"实时订阅与 WebSocket 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns/realtime-subscriptions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"architecture","title":"数据请求架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prefetching-preloading","title":"预取与预加载策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/prefetching-preloading"},{"seq":2,"slug":"request-waterfall-optimization","title":"请求瀑布流优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/request-waterfall-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"server-state-vs-client-state","title":"服务端状态与客户端状态分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/server-state-vs-client-state"}]}]}